{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can install TanStack Devtools with any "},{"type":"link","href":"https://npmjs.com","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NPM"}]},{"type":"text","value":" package manager."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Only install one of the following packages depending on your use case:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"react","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/react-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools is compatible with React v16.8+"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"preact","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Preact"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/preact-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools is compatible with Preact v10+"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"solid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/solid-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools is compatible with Solid v1.9.5+"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"vue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/vue-devtools","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Vite plugin ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/devtools-vite"},{"type":"text","value":") is optional for Vue — it enables additional features like source inspection and console piping but isn't required for basic usage."}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools is compatible with Vue 3+"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"svelte","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/svelte-devtools","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Vite plugin ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/devtools-vite"},{"type":"text","value":") is optional for Svelte — it enables additional features like source inspection and console piping but isn't required for basic usage."}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools is compatible with Svelte 5+"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"angular","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/angular-devtools","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Vite plugin ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/devtools-vite"},{"type":"text","value":") is optional for Angular — it enables additional features like source inspection and console piping but isn't required for basic usage."}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools is compatible with Angular 19+"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"vanilla-js","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vanilla JS"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/devtools","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the core "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/devtools"},{"type":"text","value":" package to use with any framework or without a framework. Each framework package up above will also re-export everything from this core package."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"production-builds","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Production Builds"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you want to have the devtools in production builds, you can install the core "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/devtools"},{"type":"text","value":" package as a regular dependency:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Read more about using the devtools in production in our "},{"type":"link","href":"./production","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Production docs"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"react","text":"React","level":2},{"id":"preact","text":"Preact","level":2},{"id":"solid","text":"Solid","level":2},{"id":"vue","text":"Vue","level":2},{"id":"svelte","text":"Svelte","level":2},{"id":"angular","text":"Angular","level":2},{"id":"vanilla-js","text":"Vanilla JS","level":2},{"id":"production-builds","text":"Production Builds","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nYou can install TanStack Devtools with any [NPM](https://npmjs.com) package manager.\n\nOnly install one of the following packages depending on your use case:\n\n## React\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/react-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with React v16.8+\n\n## Preact\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/preact-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Preact v10+\n\n## Solid\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/solid-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Solid v1.9.5+\n\n## Vue\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/vue-devtools\n```\n\nThe Vite plugin (`@tanstack/devtools-vite`) is optional for Vue — it enables additional features like source inspection and console piping but isn't required for basic usage.\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Vue 3+\n\n## Svelte\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/svelte-devtools\n```\n\nThe Vite plugin (`@tanstack/devtools-vite`) is optional for Svelte — it enables additional features like source inspection and console piping but isn't required for basic usage.\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Svelte 5+\n\n## Angular\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/angular-devtools\n```\n\nThe Vite plugin (`@tanstack/devtools-vite`) is optional for Angular — it enables additional features like source inspection and console piping but isn't required for basic usage.\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Angular 19+\n\n## Vanilla JS\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools\n```\n\nInstall the core `@tanstack/devtools` package to use with any framework or without a framework. Each framework package up above will also re-export everything from this core package.\n\n\n## Production Builds\n\nIf you want to have the devtools in production builds, you can install the core `@tanstack/devtools` package as a regular dependency:\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n \n\nRead more about using the devtools in production in our [Production docs](./production).","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Installation\nid: installation\n---\n\nYou can install TanStack Devtools with any [NPM](https://npmjs.com) package manager.\n\nOnly install one of the following packages depending on your use case:\n\n## React\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/react-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with React v16.8+\n\n## Preact\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/preact-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Preact v10+\n\n## Solid\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/solid-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Solid v1.9.5+\n\n## Vue\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/vue-devtools\n```\n\nThe Vite plugin (`@tanstack/devtools-vite`) is optional for Vue — it enables additional features like source inspection and console piping but isn't required for basic usage.\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Vue 3+\n\n## Svelte\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/svelte-devtools\n```\n\nThe Vite plugin (`@tanstack/devtools-vite`) is optional for Svelte — it enables additional features like source inspection and console piping but isn't required for basic usage.\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Svelte 5+\n\n## Angular\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/angular-devtools\n```\n\nThe Vite plugin (`@tanstack/devtools-vite`) is optional for Angular — it enables additional features like source inspection and console piping but isn't required for basic usage.\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nTanStack Devtools is compatible with Angular 19+\n\n## Vanilla JS\n\n```sh\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools\n```\n\nInstall the core `@tanstack/devtools` package to use with any framework or without a framework. Each framework package up above will also re-export everything from this core package.\n\n\n## Production Builds\n\nIf you want to have the devtools in production builds, you can install the core `@tanstack/devtools` package as a regular dependency:\n\n```sh\nnpm install @tanstack/devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n \n\nRead more about using the devtools in production in our [Production docs](./production)."}
